{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peace is broken. War is everywhere.</strong> In this retro-inspired party FPS, 1\u20134 local players face off with or against AI bots as soldiers stationed across the solar system. Choose your faction, gear up, and fight for planetary dominance\u2014or just blow stuff up for fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat challenges for unlockables or customize your battle arena: choose weapons, map, team split, game mode and more. Every game is a unique experience thanks to the AI NPCs and the randomness of your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No micro-transactions or DLC... just like the 90s! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Team Based Arena-Style Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set time and/or point limits. Optional kid-friendly paintball mode. Choose from 6 game maps (1 from beating the Map Unlock challenge). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong>: Shoot people NOT on your team for points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>King of the Hill</strong>: Race to the hill and keep enemies out long enough to get a point</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture the Phone</strong>: Grab the phone from the enemy base then back to yours for a point</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hold the Grenade</strong>: Destroy the grenade holder. Once you have it DON'T DIE for more points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Score</strong>: Play against the AI to beat your own or global high scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival</strong>: How long can you survive the AI bots? The longer you last the harder they get. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize or randomize your game\u2019s weapon slots with any of 15 